   "id": "seg-01",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "I fix the code and try to merge. But two changes fight. I write a short note about the CPU. I ask one question about the processor. I merge branches one small step at a time. Maria explains the merge conflict to me. I take out the trash, and Maria checks it. I need to do the laundry before lunch. I understand a little more than yesterday.",
   "tts": "I fix the code and try to merge. But two changes fight. I write a short note about the C P U. I ask one question about the processor. I merge branches one small step at a time. Maria explains the merge conflict to me. I take out the trash, and Maria checks it. I need to do the laundry before lunch. I understand a little more than yesterday.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-01.mp3",
   "zh": "我改好代码，尝试合并。但两处改动冲突了。我给中央处理器写了一条简短的笔记。我问了一个关于处理器的问题。我一步一步地合并分支。Maria 给我讲解合并冲突。我把垃圾拿出去，Maria 来检查。午饭前，我需要洗衣服。我比昨天多懂了一点。",
